    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d826">

                <pb facs="0901" n="781" xml:id="pg781"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">817.48 Earthquake of 1931/15: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the President of Nicaragua</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Moncada</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1931-03-31">March 31, 1931</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>I am profoundly distressed by the reports of the overwhelming disaster which has
                    befallen Nicaragua. Please be assured of my heartfelt sympathy.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Henry L. Stimson</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
